<title>USA: IPO PRICING - Ispat at $27 -- peak of range.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - Ispat at $27 -- peak of range.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	   Ispat International NV</p>
<p>   Priced At					 $27</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range	     $26 - $27</p>
<p>   Number of Shares		     25,000,000</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter CS First Boston and Donaldson, Lufkin &amp;</p>
<p>			  Jenrette</p>
<p>NOTE: The estimated price range and proposed number of shares were raised for the planned initial public offering in Ispat International NV. The estimated price range rose to $26 to $27 per common share from $22 to $26 per share previously. The proposed number of shares rose to 25 million from 19.25 million shares previously.</p>
</text>
